{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10203","headline":"晚登江楼有怀 · 李嘉佑","name":"晚登江楼有怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"独坐南楼佳兴新，青山绿水共爲隣。\n爽气遥分隔浦岫，斜光偏照渡江人。\n心闲鸥鸟时相近，事简鱼竿私自亲。\n只忆帝京不可到，秋琴一弄欲沾巾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李嘉佑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10203.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10203","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}